      "rationale": "Categorizing tickets by device/issue type is a genuinely useful axis for identifying recurring problem drivers. Values are well-grounded readings of short_description (printer->Printer, database->Database, connectivity->Network)."
    },
    {
      "name": "assignee_avg_resolution_days",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.85,
      "source_groundedness": 0.75,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Per-assignee average resolution time is a strong analytical axis for locating slow resolvers driving inefficiency. Groundedness inherits the uncertainty of resolution_days (an aggregate of it) but is a legitimate derived computation from assigned_to plus durations."
