      "name": "inefficiency_pattern",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.4,
      "source_groundedness": 0.55,
      "hallucination_observed": true,
      "rationale": "It attempts to directly flag inefficiency patterns, which is on-topic, but it is largely a composite restatement of is_high_priority, category, and resolution_days rather than a new axis, and is dominated by a couple of values. 'Delayed_Critical' assignments (e.g. 16 vs 6 days) rest on a threshold not evident from source, and it inherits the shaky resolution_days basis."
    }
